  <text xml:lang="la">
    <front>
      <div xml:id="starts-on">
        <pb ed="#P" n="1276B"/>
      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is33">
        <head xml:id="gom-is33-Hd1e98">Caput 33</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is33-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is33-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is33-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is33_1@1-3">Vae qui praedaris.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is33-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-is33-Nd1e110" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e113">Contra Sennacherib: possunt haec etiam referri ad quemlibet raptorem et ad ipsum diabolum.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is33-Dd1e117">
          <head xml:id="gom-is33-Hd1e119">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is33-d1e121">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e123" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is33_2@1-3">Domine, miserere nostri.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is33-Rd1e126"><name xml:id="gom-is33-Nd1e127" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e130">In persona populi obsessi a Sennacherib, vel potius, apostolorum et omnium fidelium.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is33-d1e133">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e135" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is33_2@10-10">Mane.</quote>
            Qui de exercitu Sennacherib remanserunt; socios mortuos viderunt et in fugam versi sunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is33-Dd1e140">
          <head xml:id="gom-is33-Hd1e142">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is33-d1e144">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e146" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is33_3@3-3">Angeli.</quote>
            Michaelis scilicet, qui princeps Judaeorum, vel Gabrielis, fortitudo et dux praeliorum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is33-Dd1e151">
          <head xml:id="gom-is33-Hd1e153">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is33-d1e155">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e157" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is33_4@7-7">Bruchus.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e160"><seg type="qs">Ex locusta bruchus nascitur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">mortuae etiam bruchos gignant.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is33-Dd1e170">
          <head xml:id="gom-is33-Hd1e172">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is33-d1e174">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1276C"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e178" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is33_6@6-6">Tuis.</quote>
            O Ezechia; vel suis secundum alios, scilicet liberati populi.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is33-d1e182">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e184" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is33_6@16-16">Ejus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is33-Rd1e187"><name xml:id="gom-is33-Nd1e188" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e191">Scilicet salutis: sine timore enim neque sapientia, neque scientia quidquam prodest, unde: <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e193" source="http://scta.info/resource/tob4_23@10-15">Habebis multa bona si timueris Deum</quote>; et: <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e196" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps110_10@1-4">Initium sapientiae timor Domini</quote>.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is33-Dd1e202">
          <head xml:id="gom-is33-Hd1e204">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is33-d1e206">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e208" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is33_8@9-9">Pactum.</quote>
            Quod pepigit Dominus cum Abraham, scilicet: <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e211" source="http://scta.info/resource/gen26_4@2-6">Multiplicabo semen tuum sicut stellae,</quote> etc. <!--<note>(Gen. XXII)</note>-->; et alibi: <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e216" source="http://scta.info/resource/zac11">Habitabis in loco isto amodo et usque in sempiternum<!-- check: cited chapter given; verse not identified --></quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is33-Dd1e222">
          <head xml:id="gom-is33-Hd1e224">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is33-d1e226">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e228" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is33_9@7-7">Libanus.</quote>
            Templum: <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e231" source="http://scta.info/resource/is33_9@19-19">Basan,</quote> Regio Og, quam dedit Moyses trans Jordanem duabus tribubus et dimidiae: haec quoque uberrima. Carmelus mons terrae promissionis fertilissimus. Per haec ergo debemus intelligere Judaeos omnem fertilitatem amisisse.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is33-Dd1e236">
          <head xml:id="gom-is33-Hd1e238">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is33-d1e240">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1276D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e244" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is33_14@9-10">Quis poterit.</quote>
            Dei magnalia narrat et Deum ignem vocat.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is33-Dd1e249">
          <head xml:id="gom-is33-Hd1e251">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is33-d1e253">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e255" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is33_17@9-9">Terram.</quote>
            Viventium. <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e258" source="http://scta.info/resource/mt5_4@1-6">Beati mites, quoniam ipsi possidebunt terram,</quote> vel in coelo positi, terrena despiciunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is33-Dd1e263">
          <head xml:id="gom-is33-Hd1e265">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is33-d1e267">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e269" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is33_20@12-13">Tabernaculum quod.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is33-Rd1e272"><name xml:id="gom-is33-Nd1e273" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e276"><seg type="qs">Tabernaculum quod habuerunt Judaei per eremum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">Ecclesia autem immobilis fundata est supra firmam petram.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is33-Dd1e286">
          <head xml:id="gom-is33-Hd1e288">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is33-d1e290">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e292" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is33_22@1-2">Dominus enim.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is33-Rd1e295"><name xml:id="gom-is33-Nd1e296" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e299"><quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e300" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps95_13@10-13">Judicabit orbem terrae in justitia.</quote></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is33-Dd1e305">
          <head xml:id="gom-is33-Hd1e307">Versus 23</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is33-d1e309">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is33-Qd1e311" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is33_23@1-4">Laxati sunt funiculi tui,</quote>
            etc. Redit ad terrenam Jerusalem, et loquitur de ea sub specie navis: superiora dicta sunt de urbe solemnitatis <pb ed="#P" n="1277A"/> nostrae quam Dominus fluviis suis circumdat.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
